From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 09:25:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 52/59] Add a measurement of the OSD transfer

With --measure the browser logs the time from a key to its first
frame and to the arrival of the frame at VDR, and every 5 seconds
statistics of the OSD transfer (frames, regions, size, wait and send
time).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
